WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.390 --> 00:13.090
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.670 --> 00:19.440
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.670 --> 00:24.940
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.450 --> 00:31.540
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.650 --> 00:37.520
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.630 --> 00:40.590
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.690 --> 00:43.660
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:48.300 --> 00:49.430
<b>Who's there nyo!</b>

00:54.480 --> 00:56.440
<b>It's leaving nyo!
How rude nyu.</b>

00:56.540 --> 00:59.100
<b>Maybe it'll come out again nyo.</b>

00:59.210 --> 01:00.680
<b>Nyu!</b>

01:01.580 --> 01:03.450
<b>It looks like
it's gone for good gema.</b>

01:03.550 --> 01:05.450
<b>Electronics
Electronics
It's a laughing ghost nyo!</b>

01:05.550 --> 01:06.950
<b>This is Akihabara</b>

01:07.050 --> 01:10.750
<b>Akihabara!
Gema!</b>

01:10.860 --> 01:14.060
<b>Doing errands for Mishter Manager
in Akihabara nyo.</b>

01:14.460 --> 01:15.720
<b>Nyo!? This voice!?</b>

01:15.830 --> 01:19.600
<b>It's the laughing ghost nyo!
It's always laughing its head off nyo!</b>

01:20.700 --> 01:22.640
<b>Mansei Bridge</b>

01:29.480 --> 01:33.570
<b>It is I, who will blow away
the oppen pen Dejiko.</b>

01:33.680 --> 01:36.310
<b>The idol the world is talking about...</b>

01:36.420 --> 01:38.390
<b>It is I, Dejiko's fearless rival,
Rabi-en-Rose!</b>

01:38.490 --> 01:39.820
<b>Hello everyone!</b>

01:39.920 --> 01:41.650
<b>Is Dejiko okay gema?</b>

01:41.760 --> 01:43.920
<b>Say it, ''Rabi-en-Rose.''</b>

01:44.020 --> 01:46.890
<b>Rabi...en...Rose...gema.</b>

01:47.130 --> 01:48.750
<b>What do you think
you're doing nyo!</b>

01:48.860 --> 01:52.420
<b>I was hit by a car, fell into the river,
and was almost eaten by a huge koi nyo!</b>

01:52.530 --> 01:56.400
<b>I am Rabi-en-Rose!
Your rival!</b>

01:56.500 --> 02:00.130
<b>You think you're all that because
everyone is focusing on you now...</b>

02:00.240 --> 02:02.230
<b>We took longer than we anticipated nyo.
...but now that your rival is here</b>

02:02.340 --> 02:03.740
<b>Gema is missing nyu.
you're nothing but an open pen!</b>

02:03.840 --> 02:05.140
<b>Shut up nyo.</b>

02:05.880 --> 02:09.140
<b>How sad to leave
without me gema.</b>

02:09.380 --> 02:11.150
<b>Welcome back Dejiko-chan.</b>

02:11.250 --> 02:14.550
<b>Mishter Manager! Guess what
happened when I was out nyo!?</b>

02:14.660 --> 02:16.280
<b>Dejiko-chan,
I was worried that...</b>

02:16.390 --> 02:20.090
<b>you were hit by a car, fell into the river
and almost eaten by a koi fish.</b>

02:20.190 --> 02:21.660
<b>That's exactly what happened nyo.</b>

02:21.760 --> 02:24.320
<b>I was harassed
by a weird laughing ghost,</b>

02:24.430 --> 02:27.200
<b>so I burnt her up
with my Laser Eye Beam nyo.</b>

02:27.300 --> 02:28.430
<b>You took long enough.</b>

02:28.540 --> 02:31.300
<b>Nyo! That's her nyo!
The laughing ghost nyo!</b>

02:31.410 --> 02:33.240
<b>Why is she here nyo!?</b>

02:33.340 --> 02:36.610
<b>She's going to start working for us today.
This is Hikaru Usada.</b>

02:36.710 --> 02:38.800
<b>She's working here nyo?
Manager! Please call me ''Rabi-en-Rose!''</b>

02:38.910 --> 02:39.880
<b>You guys be nice now.</b>

02:39.980 --> 02:41.000
<b>Usada!</b>

02:41.120 --> 02:43.520
<b>I guess I have to fight it out then!</b>

02:43.620 --> 02:46.810
<b>No way nyo.
What a hassle nyo.</b>

02:46.920 --> 02:49.120
<b>You tick me off!. Come here!</b>

02:49.220 --> 02:50.280
<b>What the...?</b>

02:50.390 --> 02:53.020
<b>It's ok. I wash my hair everyday.</b>

02:53.260 --> 02:54.520
<b>Nyo</b>

02:54.630 --> 02:56.930
<b>We are...
Fans of Dejiko-chan.</b>

02:57.030 --> 02:59.860
<b>If you're going to pick on someone,
then pick on us, not Dejiko.</b>

02:59.970 --> 03:03.230
<b>Well, we don't mean
we like to be picked on.</b>

03:03.340 --> 03:05.170
<b>I mean, it's not good
to pick on people in general...</b>

03:05.270 --> 03:06.300
<b>I didn't come here to be picked on.</b>

03:06.410 --> 03:07.500
<b>Well anyways,</b>

03:07.610 --> 03:11.010
<b>starting today,
I'm going to be working here.</b>

03:11.110 --> 03:15.010
<b>Yay! Another cute girl!
I have to come here everyday now!</b>

03:16.850 --> 03:20.310
<b>Rabi-en-Rose's popularity
makes Dejiko fade away.</b>

03:20.420 --> 03:22.860
<b>Her real name is Hikaru Usada nyo.</b>

03:22.960 --> 03:24.510
<b>Really?</b>

03:26.630 --> 03:28.690
<b>Heh Heh Heh
I told you to call me
''Rabi-en-Rose!''</b>

03:28.800 --> 03:30.350
<b>Please don't throw me gema.</b>

03:32.470 --> 03:33.260
<b>Nyu!</b>

03:33.370 --> 03:35.770
<b>Puchiko-chan!</b>

03:35.870 --> 03:38.770
<b>That's right! Dejiko's not the
only one I have to worry about!</b>

03:38.870 --> 03:41.170
<b>It's an endless battle
between the three of us!</b>

03:41.280 --> 03:43.470
<b>Don't forget me gema!</b>
